<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Scan container images during Jenkins builds using the Cortex CLI
  (Cortex Cloud Runtime Security). This plugin replaces the Prisma Cloud
  Compute (twistlock) Jenkins plugin, providing image vulnerability and
  compliance scanning with configurable pass/fail gating and per-build
  results reporting, for both freestyle and Pipeline jobs.
</div>
